The '''city center''' of [[Mos Espa]] was an area in the city that was controlled by the [[Strassi family]] following the collapse of [[Jabba's criminal empire]] after his [[death]]. [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba's]] [[majordomo]], [[Bib Fortuna]], assumed the title of [[lord]] and claimed Jabba's throne.<ref name="Chapter 3" />
